 # Changelog
 
+## Linux 0.5.3-sendoa.4 — October 29, 2026
+
+- Add an inset live border aggregated across agents: requests take priority over errors, work and completion. Respect reduced motion without changing focus, dimensions, permissions or clock.
+
+## Linux 0.5.3-sendoa.3 — October 29, 2026
+
+- Keep the compact clock visible after agents finish and during alerts; agent status remains in the miniature grid.
+
+## Linux 0.5.3-sendoa.2 — October 29, 2026
+
+- Compact now-playing view with cached artwork, track metadata and an animated waveform. Pausing restores the normal compact view after one second; clicking opens the music card with the existing spring transition.
+- Enabling the clock keeps the closed island visible without disabling expanded-card auto-close.
+- Two-line optional clock beside Mochi and the mini-agent grid. Requests and important alerts retain priority.
+- Linux MPRIS fallback for other players when Spotifast and Spotify are absent.
+
 ## Unreleased
 
 - **Mac: WhatsApp statuses aren't chats** — a contact's WhatsApp Status and channel posts no longer show up as a conversation in the WhatsApp pill (#901, same fix as #910)
